    "text": "Let the solution curve of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
